GPIO carts (RTC) and big ROMs whose game touches AGB print made mGBA copy the whole ROM, 32 MB
per player: 4 Unbound players ran out of memory. GPIO registers now read from the cartridge's
state and AGB print never maps into the ROM, so players running the same game share one
read-only ROM (docs/performance-plan.md).

